        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-01T16:24:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about opportunistic mode? Does that not have IPs? If so, suggest saying that in this comment.\n\nDoes this CL test opportunistic mode?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 228,
        "startChar": 86,
        "endLine": 228,
