      "message": "This isn\u0027t great. It\u0027s confusing that the remote address is taken from the class, but the source address is passed in. Can we leave this as is, and ensure that the TLS probes set mSocketAddress as soon as the source address is determined (i.e., as soon as connect() succeeds)?",
